{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107170","id":2571002929,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6ZPmQx","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107170","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107170.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107170.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107170","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107170/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107170/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107170/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/2bf24107fa28e30a73ceadff73d4bc0f3aa507d8","number":107170,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Optimize `LRUCache` by removing `List`","user":{"login":"YYF233333","id":67693830,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NjkzODMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67693830?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333","html_url":"https://github.com/YYF233333","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"According to the documentation, `HashMap` internally maintains the insertion order of key-value pairs using a doubly linked list. We can leverage this list to replace the `List` used in `LRUCache`, thereby reducing the need to maintain an additional list.\r\n\r\nTo improve performance (avoiding an `erase` followed by an `insert`), a `renew_key()` method was added to `HashMap` to move a key-value pair to the end of the insertion order list.\r\n\r\n`LRUCache` is rarely used and it's difficult to construct a benchmark, so I use some micro-benchmarks to evaluate the performance of individual APIs.\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>code</summary>\r\n\r\n```C++\r\n#define ANKERL_NANOBENCH_IMPLEMENT\r\n#include \"nanobench.h\"\r\n#include \"core/templates/list.h\"\r\n#include \"core/templates/local_vector.h\"\r\n\r\nclass Test\r\n{\r\npublic:\r\n    void bench_insert()\r\n    {\r\n        LRUCache<int64_t, int64_t> cache;\r\n        for (int i = 0; i < 100000; i++) {\r\n            cache.insert(i, i);\r\n        }\r\n        for (int i = 0; i < 100000; i++) {\r\n            cache.erase(i);\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    void bench_get()\r\n    {\r\n        LRUCache<int64_t, int64_t> cache;\r\n        for (int i = 0; i < 10; i++) {\r\n            cache.insert(i, i);\r\n        }\r\n        for (int i = 0; i < 100000; i++) {\r\n            cache.get(i % 10);\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    static void bench()\r\n    {\r\n        auto bench = ankerl::nanobench::Bench()\r\n            .title(\"LRUCache Benchmarks\")\r\n            .warmup(10)\r\n            .minEpochIterations(100);\r\n        bench.run(\"insert and erase\", [&]{\r\n            Test test;\r\n            test.bench_insert();\r\n        });\r\n        bench.run(\"get             \", [&]{\r\n            Test test;\r\n            test.bench_get();\r\n        });\r\n    }\r\n};\r\n```\r\n\r\n</details>\r\n\r\nResult:\r\n\r\nMaster:\r\n![屏幕截图 2025-06-06 001828](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/aefe449e-b376-4a22-8f6e-c1076b9d5a21)\r\n\r\nThis PR:\r\n![屏幕截图 2025-06-06 010846](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4d12f2f5-22d9-4344-ad9f-db149e4911a2)\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/